### Assignment 10 test requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension, or Postman)

### The first 20 books (the table now holds 50,008)
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### One book
GET http://localhost:3000/books/3

### Q5 - search by author (exact name)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/search?author=Ben%20Forta

### Q5 - the input ' OR '1'='1   (a quote is %27 and a space is %20 in a URL)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/search?author=%27%20OR%20%271%27=%271

### Q5 - a lone quote
GET http://localhost:3000/books/search?author=%27

### Customer 42's orders (the customer of Q3)
GET http://localhost:3000/customers/42/orders

### Q6 - once the app connects as bookstore_app, check that it still works.
### Place an order (customer 2 buys 2 copies of book 3)
POST http://localhost:3000/customers/2/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "book_id": 3, "quantity": 2 }

### Q6 - cancel it (replace 131076 with the id that the POST returned)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/customers/2/orders/131076
